# frame-class: a ROWS row that selects ;frame=F in a group of the class MAN: the frame number rests on the grid and the frame length, so VEXP_CLASS (the ;held=F row beside it is accepted). Review fix M-03: the control of the tag rule-vexp-frame-class.
scene	fc	case=video_fc	role=literal
group	fc	g1	form=ROWS	class=MAN:H7-18	sym=order	kills=F0,F1
row	fc	g1	line=active+0;x=0..5;frame=3	index=2*5,2*300,2*7
row	fc	g1	line=active+0;x=0..5;held=3	index=2*5,2*300,2*7
